    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f09de549c9e0cff546957068",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我忘不掉前几天试吃会上吃的蓝靛果的味道。\n不过，在本州的超市里头好像很难买到这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cb06bb2dbbbe0539149552f4ac56ea8567a0a46d27054ce76a0e052981b0b7",
