      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『哎呀哎呀！　小火山在搞街头演唱会啊！\n那孩子还真是有够努力呢。』",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b29c1646b66685060db7fc764bea9307b75ff4cbb16cb5d7c697e55ba05cc0",
